Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 14:02:39 +0000
Subject: src: migrate to setter/definer interceptor callbacks returning
 v8::Boolean

V8 removed the PropertyHandlerConfiguration constructors and
SetNativeDataProperty overloads accepting setter/definer callbacks
whose info type is PropertyCallbackInfo<void>. Switch interceptor and
accessor setter/definer callbacks to PropertyCallbackInfo<Boolean> and
register the non-deprecated callback types as external references.

